# The repo root sets `* text eol=lf`, which would corrupt binary assets that
# are not on its whitelist (and its patterns are lowercase / case-sensitive).
# The legacy CMUcam archive carries several such types, so force them binary
# here in both cases.
*.bmp binary
*.BMP binary
*.zip binary
*.ZIP binary
*.ppt binary
*.PPT binary
*.tar binary
*.TAR binary
*.jpg binary
*.JPG binary
*.jpeg binary
*.JPEG binary
*.png binary
*.PNG binary
*.pdf binary
*.PDF binary
*.gif binary
*.GIF binary
*.mp4 binary
*.MP4 binary
